{"thread":{"threadID":1450,"boardID":117,"topic":"Minigame-Maps, aussortierung.","time":1388425683,"userID":2,"username":"SkyK1ll","lastPostTime":1388425816,"lastPoster":"SkyK1ll","replies":4,"views":493,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":0},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":13652,"threadID":1450,"userID":2,"username":"SkyK1ll","subject":"Minigame-Maps, aussortierung.","time":1388425683,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hallo Community,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Aufrgund das wir zuviele Minigamemaps auf dem Server besitzen &amp; dieses eine menge User stört, gibt es nun eine Abstimmung.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ihr könnt bis zu 15 Maps wählen, die Ihr am besten findet, die &quot;ungemochtesten Maps&quot; werden vom Server entfernt, wieviele es sind, die entfernt werden, wird zu einem späteren Zeitpunkt beschlossen.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Lieber weniger Maps, dafür bessere, anstatt massiv zu viele &amp; darunter viele Maps die keiner spielen will.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong>Die Abstimmung läuft bis zum 16.01.2014</strong></p>\n<p><strong><br></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Ihr könnt jeweils 3x Abstimmen, bei allen 5 Umfragen.<br>Man musste 5 Umfragen setzen, da eine Umfrage maximal 20 Antworten haben darf.<br></strong></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":13653,"threadID":1450,"userID":2,"username":"SkyK1ll","subject":"","time":1388425726,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>2</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":13654,"threadID":1450,"userID":2,"username":"SkyK1ll","subject":"","time":1388425760,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>3</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":13655,"threadID":1450,"userID":2,"username":"SkyK1ll","subject":"","time":1388425796,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editR